        "body": "Datadog, Inc. is a public company headquartered in New York, NY, and trades under the ticker DDOG. It is registered with the SEC under CIK 0001561550. Its website presents cloud monitoring as a service, describing the ability to see metrics from apps, tools, and services in one place, with a free trial offered.\n\nThe site also addresses security, describing integration of security and observability to help organizations decode runtime execution, reduce exposure in dynamic AI environments, and carry out detection and response against AI-powered attacks. The company describes this as responding with agentic speed to threats.\n\nThe site's material does not name specific products, and no products are tracked for the company. No lawsuits or MCP servers are recorded. The company has a recorded law exposure count of 459 in New York.",
